        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager conduct pay-equity analysis: regression of pay on legitimate pay factors (grade, tenure, performance, location) controlling for gender/other protected status; identify unexplained pay gaps by grade/job
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3309_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3309_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
