        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager/Legal review flagged gaps for root cause (historical, hire-in, compression); design remediation (adjustments within budget W3327), assess legal exposure (Labor Code, links to VS-84/VS-100), and execute adjustments via payroll (links to VS-19.2)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3309_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3309_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
