Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3309_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3309_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
