    <bpmn:process id="W_W3312" name="W3312. Compensation Policy, Governance &amp; Executive Pay Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual policy review; executive pay cycle; board governance (links to VS-36)
Frequency: Annual
Volume: C&amp;B policy set + executive population
Owner: CHRO
Participants: CHRO, C&amp;B Manager, Legal (links to VS-100/VS-36), CFO, Compensation Committee, Board (links to VS-36.1)
Source: workflow W3312 — Compensation Policy, Governance &amp; Executive Pay Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3312_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3312_Lane1" name="C&amp;B Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3312_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3312_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3312_Lane2" name="CHRO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3312_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3312_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3312_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3312_Start4" name="Annual policy review; executive pay cycle; board governance (links to VS-36)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3312_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3312_Task5" name="C&amp;B Manager/CHRO maintain the compensation policy (pay philosophy, positioning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager/CHRO maintain the compensation policy (pay philosophy, positioning, merit/promotion/overtime/allowance rules, pay transparency); review and update annually for legal and market change (links to VS-22.3 regulatory change)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / CHRO
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3312_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3312_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3312_Task6" name="CHRO/Legal prepare executive pay review (base, STI links to W3321, LTI links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CHRO/Legal prepare executive pay review (base, STI links to W3321, LTI links to W3324, benefits, perquisites) benchmarked to market, with say-on-pay and disclosure readiness; submit to Compensation Committee/Board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): CHRO / Legal
Accountable (A): Compensation Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3312_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3312_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3312_Task7" name="CHRO report compensation governance outcomes, policy compliance, and pay-equity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CHRO report compensation governance outcomes, policy compliance, and pay-equity (W3309) to the board and audit committee (links to VS-36/VS-21.1); implement board directives
Responsible (R): CHRO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3312_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3312_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3312_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3312_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3312_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-122 (ensure pay equity &amp; statutory benefits compliance.) | - operational: committee/board oversight; operational: annual review
Owner: CHRO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
